# The ways make test drives test/cases through (test/run.sh, RUN_MODES):
# a label, the compiler in bin/, and the environment it runs with. Every
# case under every way is one job of the same pool.
#
# acc; opt-acc as it is with nothing asked of it; and opt-acc's backends,
# each forced where the pick would choose among them -- with the full set
# as it is measured and shipped, the pick choosing. A way here earns its
# place by objects no other way makes: the leaf backend without inlining,
# and the machine-level one caching locals, were left out when they made
# 41 and 10 of 303 cases' objects the others did not, the rest the same.
